  "citation": "Curtis P S (1999): A Database of Woody Vegetation Responses to Elevated Atmospheric CO2 (NDP-072). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/VRC.NDP072",
  "dataset": {
